WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.300
Go to the red hot
center of what's

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:05.115
important in somebody's life.

00:00:06.115 --> 00:00:07.740
Because that's where
you get the truth.

00:00:07.740 --> 00:00:10.090
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:10.090 --> 00:00:13.270
In this era, most
people are skeptical,

00:00:13.270 --> 00:00:15.430
distrustful of the news media.

00:00:16.430 --> 00:00:18.310
Everyone is a journalist.

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:23.440
You gather information,
verify it, and communicate it.

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:26.050
Everyone has their own
version of the truth.

00:00:26.050 --> 00:00:27.860
But there are facts.

00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:29.950
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:32.080
What I'm going to
teach in this class

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:34.400
is the importance
of human sources.

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:36.970
No one ever gives
you the full story.

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:39.610
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:39.610 --> 00:00:42.940
Often, it's a mix of
truth and untruth.

00:00:42.940 --> 00:00:44.480
The job is to go verify.

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:49.060
"I shall resign the presidency,
effective at noon tomorrow."

00:00:49.060 --> 00:00:52.330
The President of the United
States is not above the law.

00:00:52.330 --> 00:00:55.300
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:59.040
The human source is the
savior of journalism.

00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:02.780
In this MasterClass, I'm
going to teach you research,

00:01:02.780 --> 00:01:06.290
investigating, how to
gather information,

00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:11.000
how to interview people,
and how to find the story

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:12.100
and build the story.

00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:14.920
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:01:15.420 --> 00:01:19.605
The purpose of an interview is
not gotcha, is not to catch.

00:01:19.605 --> 00:01:21.870
I have a little
technique of sticking

00:01:21.870 --> 00:01:24.450
this finger over
my little finger,

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:29.820
jamming it down so it hurts,
and it's a reminder to shut up.

00:01:29.820 --> 00:01:32.270
And just listen.

00:01:32.270 --> 00:01:34.190
Let the silence
suck out the truth.

00:01:34.190 --> 00:01:36.630
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:01:36.630 --> 00:01:38.280
This is a time
we're being tested.

00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:40.280
Let's tell the truth.

00:01:40.280 --> 00:01:42.190
Let's not be chickenshit about this.

00:01:42.790 --> 00:01:44.910
Break the rules- not
the law, but the rules.

00:01:46.910 --> 00:01:49.800
This is the final
exam for democracy.

00:01:51.100 --> 00:01:53.660
I'm Bob Woodward, and
this is my MasterClass.

